# RivalsPulse — MVP Product Specification
# Single source of truth. Read before making any changes.

## 1. PRODUCT DESCRIPTION
RivalsPulse is a Marvel Rivals meta analytics dashboard.
It ingests match data from MarvelRivalsAPI.com through a private backend pipeline
and surfaces aggregate insights for competitive players.
Aggregate-only: NO individual player profiles, histories, or UIDs are exposed.

## 2. TARGET USERS
- Ranked Grinder: Diamond-GM optimising picks for current patch
- Casual Improver: Gold-Plat looking for "what should I play"
- Content Creator: streamer wanting shareable meta snapshots
- Theorycrafter: interested in patch trends and tier debates

## 3. CORE USER STORIES
1. See win/pick rates for all heroes to find strong meta picks.
2. Filter by role to compare within Vanguard / Duelist / Strategist.
3. See hero performance per map to adapt hero pool.
4. Get top-3 recommended picks filtered by role/rank/map.
5. Track win rate shifts across patches to understand balance impact.
6. Fast, polished experience on desktop and mobile; no account required.

## 4. MVP STAGES
| Stage | Scope                                        | Status   |
|-------|----------------------------------------------|----------|
| MVP 1 | Static frontend with mock data               | ACTIVE   |
| MVP 2 | FastAPI + PostgreSQL schema + seeding        | Planned  |
| MVP 3 | Live ingestion pipeline + Redis caching      | Planned  |
| MVP 4 | Recommendation engine + patch diffing        | Planned  |
| MVP 5 | Polish, SEO, public launch                   | Planned  |
Do NOT skip stages or implement backend logic during MVP 1.

## 5. THE 5 MVP PAGES
### 5.1 `/` Landing / Overview Dashboard
- Hero section: tagline, sub-copy, CTA -> /meta
- KPI strip: Total Heroes, Matches Analysed, Patches Covered, Last Updated
- Top 5 Heroes by Win Rate (card grid: role badge, win%, pick%)
- Role Distribution doughnut chart (Vanguard / Duelist / Strategist)
- Recent Patch banner: patch number, key bullets, link -> /patches

### 5.2 `/meta` Hero Meta Table
- Sortable/filterable TanStack Table of all heroes
- Columns: Hero, Role, Win Rate, Pick Rate, Ban Rate, KDA, Tier (S/A/B/C)
- Filters: Role (multi-select), Rank, Patch (dropdown)
- Row click navigates to /heroes/[heroId]
- Top 10 Win Rate horizontal Recharts BarChart

### 5.3 `/recommendations` Recommended Picks
- Filter bar: Role, Rank, Map
- 3 Hero recommendation cards with reasoning, stats, synergy tip, counter tip
- "Why this pick?" expandable accordion per card

### 5.4 `/heroes/[heroId]` Hero Detail Page
- Header: name, role, portrait placeholder, tier badge
- Stat cards: Win Rate, Pick Rate, Ban Rate, Avg KDA
- Win Rate Over Time line chart (last 6 patches, Recharts)
- Map Performance table: map name, win rate, pick rate
- Synergies and Counters two-column grid
- Back link -> /meta

### 5.5 `/patches` Patch History
- Timeline list newest-first
- Per patch: version, date, summary bullets, affected heroes badge list
- Hero Impact grouped BarChart showing delta win rate per hero
- Patch selector for side-by-side comparison (MVP 4 placeholder)

